{"nodes":[{"id":"core","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":420,"height":220,"text":"# 十元发散引擎\n\n不是十元分类器，也不是仓库抽卡器。\n\n核心：任意对象/问题 → 锁定问题 → 找变量 → 单十元深发散 → 十元横向扫描 → 多十元组合 → 验证收束 → 创作输出"},{"id":"rule","type":"text","x":0,"y":-330,"width":420,"height":240,"text":"## Canvas 权限\n- 这是可视化工作台，不是理论正本\n- current canonical 永远高于 Canvas\n- 不得由职业/身份/情绪/颜色/题材/单名词倒推十元\n- mapping 只作案例、证据、边界校验与具象参考\n- 自动任务只镜像真实进展，不制造假节点"},{"id":"input","type":"text","x":-900,"y":20,"width":300,"height":190,"text":"## 入口\n任意对象 / 题材 / 故事 / 创作卡点 / 问题\n\n例：\n“一个想成为偶像的少女”\n“这个故事太普通”\n“这个关系没有戏”"},{"id":"lock_problem","type":"text","x":-520,"y":20,"width":300,"height":190,"text":"## 1｜锁定问题\n先问：到底哪里有问题？\n\n身份 / 目标 / 路径 / 关系 / 冲突 / 代价 / 结局 / 机制……\n\n不急着调用十元。"},{"id":"find_variable","type":"text","x":-520,"y":280,"width":300,"height":190,"text":"## 2｜变量发现\n把“普通/没戏/卡住”改写成可改变变量。\n\n输出：\n- object_layer\n- current state\n- changed_variable candidate\n- 可观测结果"},{"id":"single_deep","type":"text","x":560,"y":-180,"width":360,"height":230,"text":"# A｜单十元深发散\n一个十元自己长树。\n\n每元至少维护：\n1. 核心变量\n2. 发现问题\n3. 母级变换动作\n4. 子级分叉问题\n5. 继续发散规则\n6. 停止条件\n7. 邻居排除\n8. 反例\n9. 可组合接口"},{"id":"horizontal","type":"text","x":560,"y":120,"width":360,"height":190,"text":"# B｜十元横向扫描\n同一个问题同时交给十个十元寻找不同变量。\n\n目标不是判断“它属于谁”，而是发现：\n同一对象还能从哪些结构方向被改写？"},{"id":"combine","type":"text","x":560,"y":380,"width":360,"height":240,"text":"# C｜双/三十元交叉\n把已经独立成立的分支重新组合。\n\n必须保留各自 responsibility / relation_source。\n禁止 percent / weight / ratio。\n组合要产生新结构，不是把两个标签粘一起。\n\n新增硬门：same characters / same window / same broad relation label 都不够，必须核对 same object + same changed_variable。"},{"id":"verify","type":"text","x":560,"y":650,"width":360,"height":250,"text":"# D｜验证与收束\n- nearest neighbor\n- removal test\n- reverse test\n- counterexample\n- same-object-layer / changed-variable gate\n- 是否只是题材/名词换皮\n- 是否真正改变结构\n- 是否能继续长树\n\n收束成少量高价值方案。"},{"id":"outputs","type":"text","x":1040,"y":380,"width":320,"height":220,"text":"## 应用输出\n十元发散引擎不是只服务角色。\n\n可落地为：\n角色 / 故事 / 题材 / 世界观 / 关系 / 场景 / 游戏机制 / 镜头 / 创作卡点解决"},{"id":"zx","type":"text","x":-980,"y":650,"width":300,"height":180,"text":"### zx｜方向权发散\n发现：哪里存在最终方向由主体生成、夺取、扩大或公开反推？\n\n待扩：母变换动作 / 子分叉 / 纯 zx 边界"},{"id":"nx","type":"text","x":-640,"y":650,"width":300,"height":180,"text":"### nx｜外置通道发散\n发现：哪里已有外部方向、权限或通道，主体如何接入、续接、借力？\n\n待扩：任务 / 权限 / 位置 / 网络 / 改题权"},{"id":"zn","type":"text","x":-300,"y":650,"width":300,"height":180,"text":"### zn｜原则未来调用发散\n发现：什么在身份、收益、环境改变后，仍有资格进入未来判断？\n\n待扩：跨阶段 / 修订 / 利益冲突 / 身份变化"},{"id":"x","type":"text","x":40,"y":930,"width":300,"height":240,"text":"### x｜处置权发散\n发现：什么对象/资源真正归谁处置？\n\n当前发散候选维度需按正本边界校验：scope / permission / revocability / final decision / execution。\n\n已新增：scope/path-set 候选 + protected-range topology/window 动态分支。均不自动升级 canonical。"},{"id":"n","type":"text","x":-980,"y":930,"width":300,"height":180,"text":"### n｜内部承载发散\n发现：什么进入之后，被内部真实、持续地承载？\n\n待扩：准入 / 负荷 / 压力 / 重复进入 / 异质协调"},{"id":"x_parallel_z","type":"text","x":-640,"y":930,"width":300,"height":180,"text":"### x并z｜对外接口发散\n发现：什么内部结构形成稳定公共壳/对外接口？\n\n待按 current canonical 继续建立发散操作，禁止靠“公开感”倒推。"},{"id":"xn","type":"text","x":-300,"y":930,"width":300,"height":180,"text":"### xn｜运行组织发散\n发现：什么运行过程正在组织时间、流程、阶段与执行？\n\n待扩：流程重组 / 节点 / 时序 / 调度 / 执行结构"},{"id":"z","type":"text","x":40,"y":650,"width":300,"height":180,"text":"### z｜确认发散\n发现：什么对象被谁明确看见、回应、确认和采用？\n\n当前应用映射仍有 pending-review 债务，Canvas 不替 canonical 裁决。"},{"id":"xz","type":"text","x":380,"y":930,"width":300,"height":210,"text":"### xz｜未来关闭发散\n发现：哪些未来回头路正在关闭？\n\n母分支示例：\n时间窗口 / 资格窗口 / 路径减少 / 代价上升 / 单次选择锁死 / 信息错位 / 外部封路 / 历史选择反噬"},{"id":"nz","type":"text","x":720,"y":930,"width":300,"height":240,"text":"### nz｜回返修复发散\n发现：哪些对象特异关系/位置，在离开或受损后仍保留真实回返、修复、重新接近路径？\n\n已出现可执行母分支：冲突修复型 nz。\n核心不是“舍不得”，而是关系在断开后仍保有现实可调用的 bilateral reentry + repair。"},{"id":"automation_protocol","type":"text","x":1510,"y":-220,"width":430,"height":330,"text":"# 自动任务 → Canvas 镜像协议\n每次自动任务只有出现真实进展才扩展 Canvas。\n\n每轮可视节点至少记录：\n- 任务名 / 时间\n- 本轮真正解决的问题\n- 新发现变量\n- 新增/修正的发散分支\n- 组合或验证结果\n- rejected / nearest-neighbor 结论\n- 实际修改文件\n- commit SHA\n- 下一断点\n\n禁止只写“继续推进”。无真实变化不制造进展节点。"},{"id":"runlog","type":"text","x":1510,"y":200,"width":430,"height":300,"text":"# 自动任务运行轨迹区\n\n当前方向切换：\n“生成器/映射抽卡”降为应用层；研发中心改为“十元变量发现 + 单十元深发散 + 横向扫描 + 多元组合 + 验证收束”。\n\n起始 main：912499679248faedba74762cbe8692a85f836546\n最新已镜像源：6103099920cee0c614b5fca8c16bb01ca7725540"},{"id":"assets","type":"text","x":1040,"y":690,"width":320,"height":250,"text":"## 现有资产的新位置\ncanonical = 边界\nevidence = 成立证据\nmapping = 案例/参考/校验\n64题材库 = 落地空间\n角色生成器 = 一个应用端\nCanvas = 研发可视化镜像\n\n应用端新增硬门：trigger registry 与 compiler token/version 必须一致，否则 fail closed。"},{"id":"x_scope_pending_20260905","type":"text","x":380,"y":1210,"width":460,"height":430,"text":"## x｜scope / path-set 发散候选（L4 pending-review）\n来源：63883d7a7b648a63292ac054405021d8783eb3b1\n状态：pending-review，禁止覆盖 canonical\n\n本轮可用于发散的 changed_variable 候选：\n- 被测 object / object layer\n- permission_type\n- scope：局部 / 全局 / 对象子集\n- term / revocability / return obligation\n- final decision / execution topology\n- override / veto / co-decision nodes\n- actor-indexed relevant path-set\n- actuator layer / target-effect layer\n- surviving path count\n- scope / permission transition\n\n可执行分叉问题：\n1. 同一主体到底掌握哪一种权限，而不是笼统“有权”？\n2. 局部处置能否扩大到全局，还是仍有上位覆盖？\n3. 权限是临时、可撤回、需返还，还是持续？\n4. 决策权与现实执行路径是否在同一节点？\n5. 原路径失效后，替代路径是否属于同 actor + 同 object/actuator layer？\n\n边界护栏：窄 scope 成立 ≠ 宽 scope 自动成立；宽 scope 不成立 ≠ 窄 current x 自动为假。\n\n2026-09-05 总纲同步护栏：same actor + same higher-level target effect ≠ same x execution-object path set；仅作一致性确认，不新增机制节点。"},{"id":"run_20260905_1632_xscope","type":"text","x":1510,"y":570,"width":520,"height":390,"text":"### 2026-09-05｜x-scope pending-review 镜像\n任务：十元发散引擎 Canvas 扩散\n检查范围：6ecc4ea… → 63883d7…（1 commit）\n\n真正解决的问题：把最新 x scope/path-set 研究转译为“单十元 x 可发散变量”，但保持 pending-review 身份。\n\n来源 commit：63883d7a7b648a63292ac054405021d8783eb3b1\n实际修改源文件：07-Codex大脑库/待审议问题_zn-x-xscope权限类型范围期限与最终归属分层边界_20260830.md\n\n新变量：object layer / permission type / scope / term / revocability / decision topology / execution path-set / transition。\n\n新增分支：x 的 scope/path-set 发散候选。\n拒绝：把 formal authority、单次 compliance、接口持有、作品 ownership 标签直接升级成完整 x。\n验证：actor index、object/actuator layer、target-effect layer 必须分账。\n\n下一断点：继续等真实提交，优先镜像其它单十元可执行发散语法；x 这组仍等待 canonical 层裁决。"},{"id":"nz_conflict_repair_20260905","type":"text","x":900,"y":1210,"width":500,"height":500,"text":"## nz｜冲突修复型回返发散（L4 evidence-locked candidate）\n来源：82985fccb036d425435961e9c50b4d6890664169\n案例：红楼梦 宝玉↔黛玉，第二十九→三十回\n权限：L4 may_override_canonical=false\n\nchanged_variable：\n真实对象特异关系 → 严重冲突/暂时断开 → 现实重入请求 → 对方仍保留接纳资格 → 双方回应 → 修复并恢复共同接近。\n\n可执行母分支：\n1. 断开强度：争执 / 决裂 / 退出 / 长期分离\n2. 重入资格：仍在 / 条件化 / 需重建 / 已永久撤销\n3. 发起拓扑：单方发起但双方响应 / 双方同时 / 第三方牵线\n4. 修复深度：重新接触 / 恢复协作 / 恢复亲密 / 重建共同位置\n5. 自由性：可真实拒绝 vs 被身份/资源/强制拉回\n6. 第三方依赖：修复由双方完成 vs 主要由外部节点完成\n\n继续分叉问题：\n- 对象是不是同一个关系/位置，而非换了替代对象？\n- 冲突后是否真的出现现实 reentry，而非单方怀念？\n- 对方是否有拒绝自由，却仍实际回应？\n- 修复恢复了什么：称谓、接触、协作、共同节奏还是长期关系资格？\n- 拿掉爱情/宿命/悲剧情绪后，回返机制还成立吗？\n\n反例护栏：感情深 / 舍不得 / 哭得厉害 / 命中注定 ≠ nz。关键证据是对象特异 + bilateral reentry + repair。"},{"id":"run_20260905_1832_nzrepair","type":"text","x":1510,"y":1020,"width":560,"height":500,"text":"### 2026-09-05｜nz 冲突修复型发散镜像\n任务：十元发散引擎 Canvas 扩散\n检查范围：63883d7… → 82985fc…（3 commits，其中 6713281 为上轮 Canvas 自身提交）\n\n真正解决的问题：把水轴新增 pure-nz 正例转成可执行的单十元 nz 发散语法；同时核对火轴总纲同步是否产生新机制。\n\n来源提交：\n- c779776551939e5baabddd130b58ffac9603f780：火轴总纲同步，仅确认既有 x 护栏，无新机制节点\n- 82985fccb036d425435961e9c50b4d6890664169：新增宝黛冲突修复 pure-nz positive control\n\n实际修改源文件：\n- 07-Codex大脑库/zn-x火轴研究总纲_20260827.md\n- 07-Codex大脑库/待审议问题_xz-nz_红楼梦宝黛冲突回返pure-nz正例_20260905.md\n\n新变量：relation-specific reentry eligibility / repair capacity / bilateral response / repair depth / third-factor dependence。\n新增分支：nz → conflict-repair-and-real-reentry。\n拒绝：爱情深、青梅竹马、悲剧预感、单方怀念、强制留置、外部命令式复合直接算 nz。\n验证：nearest-neighbor 分账 z/x/n/nx；removal 后仍成立；reverse 将永久拒绝/单方回忆/强制回返设为明显下降。\n\n下一断点：优先等待同 current window + same object layer 的 xz=true 与 nz=true 共现样本；单十元层继续扩其它十元的可执行母分支。"},{"id":"generator_contract_20260905","type":"text","x":1040,"y":980,"width":440,"height":390,"text":"## 应用层｜trigger registry ↔ compiler 契约硬门\n来源：770fafb8725fc49f72e9f5308a93485c6c208360 + d354f9da292884094d5c25600fa4b86a2c891008\n状态：真实代码+测试已提交；完整 runtime suite 仍不得冒充已通过\n\nchanged_variable：运行时 canonical token 集与 parser_version 的一致性。\n\n新增执行约束：\n- compiler 必须导出 CANONICAL\n- compiler token 不得重复\n- compiler token 集必须与 trigger_registry 完全一致\n- compiler 必须导出 PARSER_VERSION\n- parser version 必须与 registry 一致\n- 任一漂移立即 fail closed\n\n新增测试覆盖：\n1. 缺失 x并z 等 token → CANONICAL_MISMATCH\n2. 重复 token → CANONICAL_DUPLICATE\n3. parser version 漂移 → VERSION_MISMATCH\n\n意义：角色生成器这个下游应用不能再悄悄维护第二套十元 token 真相；这不是新 canonical，只是执行层守门。"},{"id":"run_20260905_1933_generator_contract","type":"text","x":1510,"y":1580,"width":570,"height":470,"text":"### 2026-09-05｜生成器 compiler-registry 契约镜像\n任务：十元发散引擎 Canvas 扩散\n检查范围：82985fcc… → d354f9da…（3 commits，其中 ff5a055 为上轮 Canvas 自身提交）\n\n真正解决的问题：把五行轴角色生成器新增的 trigger_registry ↔ compiler fail-closed 契约画入应用执行层，而不是误写成十元语义进展。\n\n来源提交：\n- 770fafb8725fc49f72e9f5308a93485c6c208360：新增 validateCompilerContract 与 preflight 硬门\n- d354f9da292884094d5c25600fa4b86a2c891008：补 compiler token/version drift 测试\n\n实际修改源文件：\n- 09-给674（我）用的库/09-方法论与工作流/五行轴角色生成器/实现/repo_preflight_v0.1.js\n- 09-给674（我）用的库/09-方法论与工作流/五行轴角色生成器/实现/repo_preflight_v0.1.test.js\n\n新变量：runtime canonical token-set consistency / parser_version consistency。\n新增分支：应用端 fail-closed contract；不新增任何十元语义分支。\n验证：缺 token、重复 token、版本漂移都有明确失败路径。\n拒绝：把应用层 token 列表当成新的 canonical 正本；把新增测试数量冒充完整 runtime PASS。\n\n下一断点：优先镜像新的单十元可执行发散语法；若生成器继续推进，则只把与发散引擎输入契约、可复现性、锁定/重抽稳定性直接相关的实现变化画入应用层。"},{"id":"x_protected_range_topology_20260905","type":"text","x":900,"y":1780,"width":560,"height":560,"text":"## x｜protected-range 风险拓扑 / current-window 发散（L4 evidence-locked，may_override_canonical=false）\n来源：36dd5ff544a13e77378a4f8f1a9e54c63fa44dc5 + 6480461b6ac71fbf4fa188ca4d8f2697e9f0f96d\n\nchanged_variable：不是只改‘墙开/关’，而是显式改变 risk_channel / ingress_path / ingress_topology / current_window。\n\n可执行母分支：\n1. boundary deployed，但从未对当前强度/风险通过真实 risk-test\n2. 已验证 ON，随后同一 broad risk family 的 ingress topology 改变，保护可转 OFF\n3. underlying management / boundary x 仍在，但 protected-range 状态独立变化\n4. 同一 boundary 在不同 risk channel / ingress path 下分别 PASS / FAIL\n5. nominal repair / re-enabled 之后，必须重新经同 risk-channel 的现实测试，不能靠状态位恢复 ON\n\nWorld War Z 新增动态：\nverified ON under topology A → zombie vertical aggregation / body-pile creates topology B → real breach / OFF。\n\nThe Purge 护栏：security boundary ON / armed / re-enabled ≠ stable protected-range ON；re-enabled ≠ restored protection。\n\n继续分叉问题：\n- 过去通过的是哪一个 risk_channel + ingress_topology？\n- 当前威胁是否产生了新的可达路径？\n- underlying x 是否保留，而保护状态单独迁移？\n- repair 后是否有新的真实 risk-test？\n- current window 是否已经改变？\n\n边界：这是 protected-range 专项的应用发散语法，不等于把 x canonical 扩张为‘保护感’；状态必须由现实排除/阻断结果校验。\n\n状态纠偏：67198a3ee17024f5c6557fd6ff26f7297a209e90 确认 effective dynamic = 2 controls / 2 independent works；该提交 +0 control / +0 work，仅修正统计状态，不新增发散机制。"},{"id":"run_20260905_2034_xprotected","type":"text","x":1510,"y":2110,"width":590,"height":560,"text":"### 2026-09-05｜x protected-range topology 动态镜像\n任务：十元发散引擎 Canvas 扩散\n检查范围：d354f9da… → 6480461b…（3 commits，其中 cc85b1e 为上轮 Canvas 自身提交）\n\n真正解决的问题：把 protected-range 从静态‘边界在不在’推进成可执行的 risk-topology + current-window 动态发散，并补‘重新启用≠保护恢复’的负向护栏。\n\n来源提交：\n- 36dd5ff544a13e77378a4f8f1a9e54c63fa44dc5：The Purge guard，boundary-state ON / re-enabled 不足以推出 stable protected-range\n- 6480461b6ac71fbf4fa188ca4d8f2697e9f0f96d：World War Z dynamic failure，已验证安全区因同类风险出现新的 vertical aggregation topology 而由 ON→OFF\n\n实际修改源文件：\n- 07-Codex大脑库/待审议问题_zn-x-protected-range稳定保护范围经真实risk-test成立边界_20260831.md\n- 07-Codex大脑库/运行记录_zn-x-protected-range动态失败镜像_WorldWarZ_耶路撒冷墙此前已形成稳定安全区但同一僵尸风险因群体堆叠形成垂直绕越拓扑而突破故stable-protected-range必须绑定risk-topology与current-window_20260905.md\n\n新变量：risk_channel / ingress_path / ingress_topology / current_window / boundary_state / tested_protection_state。\n新增分支：x → protected-range topology-sensitive dynamic transition。\n修正：re-enabled / armed / deployed 只是 boundary state，不等于 protection predicate PASS。\n拒绝：因为 underlying management x 仍在，就假定 protected-range 必然保持 ON；因为 broad risk 名称没变，就把过去 PASS 外推到新 ingress topology。\n验证：The Purge 与 World War Z 最近邻分账；前者锁‘从未通过当前 risk-test’，后者锁‘曾通过但拓扑改变后转 OFF’。\n\n下一断点：优先寻找 nominal/technical repair 后在 same actor + same boundary + same risk channel 下再次真实 FAIL 的动态失败镜像；并继续扩尚只有一句定义的其它单十元。"},{"id":"xz_nz_false_same_layer_guard_20260905","type":"text","x":900,"y":2420,"width":580,"height":610,"text":"## xz × nz｜伪同层共现护栏（L4 candidate / deferred）\n来源：6103099920cee0c614b5fca8c16bb01ca7725540\n案例：红楼梦 宝玉↔黛玉，第96–98回\n权限：may_override_canonical=false；不得 evidence-lock 为 strict 共现\n\n本轮真正新增的 changed_variable gate：\nsame characters + same current window + same broad relation label ≠ same object layer。\n\n表面都叫“宝黛关系”，实际至少拆成：\n1. xz 候选：婚配处置路径 / 家族推进的婚姻结果空间持续收窄\n2. nz 测试：宝玉↔黛玉是否仍有对象特异、自由、现实可调用的 bilateral reentry / repair\n\n严格审计：\n- same_characters = true\n- same_broad_relation_label = true\n- same_current_window = true\n- same_changed_variable = false / unresolved\n- same_object_layer = false\n- strict_xz_nz = false\n\n可执行组合门：\nactor + object + changed_variable + reality_anchor 四项必须对齐，才能进入 same-layer 组合判断。\n\nremoval：拿掉历史 nz，婚配路径收窄仍可成立；拿掉婚配路径 xz，历史 nz 仍可独立成立。\nreverse：开放婚配选项只降低 xz，不自动产生双方重接；永久拒绝 reentry 只降低 nz，不自动改变婚配处置。\n\n拒绝：用“都是宝黛关系”“都是命运爱情悲剧”“同一对人物同一时段”直接制造 xz+nz 共现。\n\n状态：只新增 deferred false-same-layer guard，不增加 evidence-locked control/work。"},{"id":"run_20260905_2232_water_guard","type":"text","x":1510,"y":2730,"width":600,"height":560,"text":"### 2026-09-05｜xz×nz 伪同层共现护栏镜像\n任务：十元发散引擎 Canvas 扩散\n检查范围：6480461b… → 61030999…（3 commits，其中 3dceaec 为上轮 Canvas 自身提交）\n\n真正解决的问题：把水轴“同人物/同窗口/同关系标签仍可能不是同 changed_variable”的失败样本，转成多十元交叉前的结构硬门。\n\n来源提交：\n- 67198a3ee17024f5c6557fd6ff26f7297a209e90：protected-range effective dynamic 状态纠偏为 2/2；+0 control/+0 work，合并到既有 x 节点，不造重复机制\n- 6103099920cee0c614b5fca8c16bb01ca7725540：宝黛后期 false-same-layer guard，candidate/deferred\n\n实际修改源文件：\n- 07-Codex大脑库/状态同步_zn-x-protected-range_WorldWarZ动态已锁但registry专项总纲仍停1比1故effective应为2比2_20260905.md\n- 07-Codex大脑库/待审议问题_xz-nz_红楼梦宝黛后期婚配路径与关系回返伪同层护栏_20260905.md\n\n新变量：object_layer / changed_variable / reality_anchor / current-window cooccurrence validity。\n新增分支：组合验证 → false-same-layer guard。\n拒绝：same characters + same window + same broad relation label 直接视为同层共现。\n验证：nearest-neighbor 分账 z/x/xn/nz；removal 与 reverse 均显示两端可独立变化。\n\n下一断点：优先寻找真正 same actor + same current window + same object + same changed_variable 的 xz=true + nz=true 样本；同时继续补 zx/nx/zn/n/xn/z/x并z 的单十元可执行母分支。"}],"edges":[{"id":"e_input_lock","fromNode":"input","toNode":"lock_problem","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left"},{"id":"e_lock_var","fromNode":"lock_problem","toNode":"find_variable","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_var_core","fromNode":"find_variable","toNode":"core","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left"},{"id":"e_core_single","fromNode":"core","toNode":"single_deep","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left"},{"id":"e_core_horizontal","fromNode":"core","toNode":"horizontal","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left"},{"id":"e_single_combine","fromNode":"single_deep","toNode":"combine","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_horizontal_combine","fromNode":"horizontal","toNode":"combine","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_combine_verify","fromNode":"combine","toNode":"verify","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_verify_output","fromNode":"verify","toNode":"outputs","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left"},{"id":"e_rule_core","fromNode":"rule","toNode":"core","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_core_zx","fromNode":"core","toNode":"zx","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_core_nx","fromNode":"core","toNode":"nx","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_core_zn","fromNode":"core","toNode":"zn","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_core_z","fromNode":"core","toNode":"z","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_core_n","fromNode":"core","toNode":"n","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_core_xpz","fromNode":"core","toNode":"x_parallel_z","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_core_xn","fromNode":"core","toNode":"xn","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_core_x","fromNode":"core","toNode":"x","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_core_xz","fromNode":"core","toNode":"xz","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_core_nz","fromNode":"core","toNode":"nz","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_protocol_runlog","fromNode":"automation_protocol","toNode":"runlog","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_runlog_core","fromNode":"runlog","toNode":"core","fromSide":"left","toSide":"right"},{"id":"e_output_assets","fromNode":"outputs","toNode":"assets","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_x_pending","fromNode":"x","toNode":"x_scope_pending_20260905","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_x_pending_verify","fromNode":"x_scope_pending_20260905","toNode":"verify","fromSide":"right","toSide":"bottom"},{"id":"e_runlog_20260905","fromNode":"runlog","toNode":"run_20260905_1632_xscope","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_run_xscope","fromNode":"run_20260905_1632_xscope","toNode":"x_scope_pending_20260905","fromSide":"left","toSide":"right"},{"id":"e_nz_conflict_repair","fromNode":"nz","toNode":"nz_conflict_repair_20260905","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_nz_conflict_verify","fromNode":"nz_conflict_repair_20260905","toNode":"verify","fromSide":"right","toSide":"bottom"},{"id":"e_runlog_nzrepair","fromNode":"runlog","toNode":"run_20260905_1832_nzrepair","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_run_nzrepair","fromNode":"run_20260905_1832_nzrepair","toNode":"nz_conflict_repair_20260905","fromSide":"left","toSide":"right"},{"id":"e_assets_generator_contract","fromNode":"assets","toNode":"generator_contract_20260905","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_generator_contract_verify","fromNode":"generator_contract_20260905","toNode":"verify","fromSide":"left","toSide":"right"},{"id":"e_runlog_generator_contract","fromNode":"runlog","toNode":"run_20260905_1933_generator_contract","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_run_generator_contract","fromNode":"run_20260905_1933_generator_contract","toNode":"generator_contract_20260905","fromSide":"left","toSide":"right"},{"id":"e_x_protected_topology","fromNode":"x","toNode":"x_protected_range_topology_20260905","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_x_protected_verify","fromNode":"x_protected_range_topology_20260905","toNode":"verify","fromSide":"left","toSide":"right"},{"id":"e_runlog_xprotected","fromNode":"runlog","toNode":"run_20260905_2034_xprotected","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_run_xprotected","fromNode":"run_20260905_2034_xprotected","toNode":"x_protected_range_topology_20260905","fromSide":"left","toSide":"right"},{"id":"e_xz_false_same_layer","fromNode":"xz","toNode":"xz_nz_false_same_layer_guard_20260905","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_nz_false_same_layer","fromNode":"nz","toNode":"xz_nz_false_same_layer_guard_20260905","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_false_same_layer_combine","fromNode":"xz_nz_false_same_layer_guard_20260905","toNode":"combine","fromSide":"left","toSide":"right"},{"id":"e_false_same_layer_verify","fromNode":"xz_nz_false_same_layer_guard_20260905","toNode":"verify","fromSide":"left","toSide":"right"},{"id":"e_runlog_water_guard","fromNode":"runlog","toNode":"run_20260905_2232_water_guard","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_run_water_guard","fromNode":"run_20260905_2232_water_guard","toNode":"xz_nz_false_same_layer_guard_20260905","fromSide":"left","toSide":"right"}]}